Z||000000||GTDusty||10-29-2001||08:26 PM|||| turns out that the middle plug in the back was misfiring. Now when I start it, it revs to about 3 grand for about 30 secs and then slows down and dies. Also..when the key is off I can hear something running..kinda making a ticking or tapping noise. I cant quite find the source..its not the fan in my side scoop..or the radiator fans..but it seems to be coming from under the car about the middle somewhere. The good news shes finally running though. <P> Dusty<P>Oh yeah..I gave her a bath today and hand scrubbed the whole car. Armor-all the interior and Wet-Tired the wheels! She looks much better.||||reg||8
